	indigo_ccd_rpi_main.c:33:66: error: passing argument 2 of ‘indigo_xml_device_adapter’ makes pointer from integer without a cast [-Wint-conversion]
	   33 |   indigo_client *protocol_adapter = indigo_xml_device_adapter(0, 1);
		  |                                                                  ^
		  |                                                                  |
		  |                                                                  int
	In file included from indigo_ccd_rpi_main.c:27:
	/builddir/build/BUILD/indigo-3.0.4-build/indigo-3.0-4/indigo_libs/indigo/indigo_driver_xml.h:48:101: note: expected ‘indigo_uni_handle *’ but argument is of type ‘int’
	   48 | INDIGO_EXTERN indigo_client *indigo_xml_device_adapter(indigo_uni_handle *input, indigo_uni_handle *output);
		  |                                                                                  ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^~~~~~
